{"id":3337,"date":"2026-06-22T09:09:44","date_gmt":"2026-06-22T09:09:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3337"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:15:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:15:50","slug":"floral-heritage-decorative-stone-mural","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/floral-heritage-decorative-stone-mural\/","title":{"rendered":"Floral Heritage Decorative Stone Mural"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"1059\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles presents the <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"653\">Floral Heritage Decorative Stone Mural Panel<\/strong>, a premium handcrafted decorative wall art solution inspired by nature\u2019s beauty and timeless architectural craftsmanship. Designed with intricate hand-carved floral detailing, this elegant stone mural beautifully combines artistic botanical patterns, delicate leaf structures, sculpted branches, floral motifs, and decorative bird elements that create a sophisticated statement piece for luxury interiors.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1508\">The refined dual-tone design featuring a premium ivory stone base with elegant golden accent highlights adds visual depth and premium luxury aesthetics, making it ideal for spaces that demand artistic sophistication and contemporary decorative styling. Expertly crafted using high-quality stone materials, this decorative mural offers exceptional durability, long-lasting finish quality, and minimal maintenance for everyday interior applications.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1907\">Designed for premium residential and commercial architectural projects, this handcrafted mural transforms ordinary walls into artistic focal points, making it an ideal choice for luxury homes, villas, premium apartments, boutique hotels, reception areas, office interiors, restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and bespoke interior design projects where elegance and craftsmanship become part of the sp